# F*: F* reference manual (Proof-oriented Programming in F*, lexical structure and keywords); requirements/languages/fstar.md
name     fstar fst fsti

keyword  module open let rec val type and assume assert match with fun function if then else begin end
keyword  effect new_effect sub_effect layered_effect inline_for_extraction noextract private abstract
keyword  unfold irreducible opaque friend include requires ensures decreases exists forall returns
keyword  calc by introduce eliminate
type     Type Type0 nat int bool unit string list option prop squash
builtin  True False true false Some None

ident-part     '
line-comment   //
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   " "  : escapes
escape        : x=2 u4
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~@.
upper-type
hook     apostrophe
